{"session_id":"svc-1778694628022439682","seq":1,"type":"session.end","ts":"2026-05-13T17:53:36.661982829Z","data":{"status":"success","output":"Updated the routing and snapshot docs to be snapshot-first and chat-context-independent.\n\nWhat changed:\n- [FEAT-004](/var/tmp/ddx-exec-wt/.execute-bead-wt-fizeau-64a85a3d-20260513T175025-e630aa9f/docs/helix/01-frame/features/FEAT-004-model-routing.md) now states `route(client_inputs, fiz_models_snapshot)`, defines the client-input set, treats the `fiz models` snapshot as the only routing fact source, and distinguishes hard gates from scoring inputs.\n- [ADR-011](/var/tmp/ddx-exec-wt/.execute-bead-wt-fizeau-64a85a3d-20260513T175025-e630aa9f/docs/helix/02-design/adr/ADR-011-cost-based-routing-with-quota-pools.md) now uses PAYG-equivalent effective cost for subscription scoring, keeps `actual_cash_spend=false`, and makes explicit that pay-per-token providers only create actual metered spend when dispatch is opted in.\n- [CONTRACT-003](/var/tmp/ddx-exec-wt/.execute-bead-wt-fizeau-64a85a3d-20260513T175025-e630aa9f/docs/helix/02-design/contracts/CONTRACT-003-fizeau-service.md) now describes the public routing contract as `route(client_inputs, fiz_models_snapshot)` and makes the snapshot/freshness ownership explicit.\n- [ADR-012](/var/tmp/ddx-exec-wt/.execute-bead-wt-fizeau-64a85a3d-20260513T175025-e630aa9f/docs/helix/02-design/adr/ADR-012-per-source-on-disk-cache.md) now says `fiz models` is quick by default, `--refresh` blocks on routing-relevant stale fields, and `--refresh-all` blocks on all refreshable fields.\n- [docs/routing/index.md](/var/tmp/ddx-exec-wt/.execute-bead-wt-fizeau-64a85a3d-20260513T175025-e630aa9f/docs/routing/index.md), [docs/routing/policies.md](/var/tmp/ddx-exec-wt/.execute-bead-wt-fizeau-64a85a3d-20260513T175025-e630aa9f/docs/routing/policies.md), [docs/routing/best-provider.md](/var/tmp/ddx-exec-wt/.execute-bead-wt-fizeau-64a85a3d-20260513T175025-e630aa9f/docs/routing/best-provider.md), and [docs/routi